committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790600123 +0900

Parallelise E1, add single-flight LLM calls, E2 driver, noise floor

Smoke showed the GPU idling between write waves; E1 now builds and
maintains cells concurrently and runs several worlds at once, and the
LLM client coalesces identical in-flight requests so concurrent cells
still share one writer output. Adds the E2 writer-switch driver with a
disjoint calibration set and cache warming for the TP=2 window, and a
second-ingestion noise floor in E1. Keeps run manifests, env and
analysis in git; the stage 0.4 smoke record is included.

